  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#3598db\">德国二战军服模组</span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">通过这款二战德国军服模组，步入历史的长河。这款精心制作的模组为你的游戏带来了历史真实感与对细节的关注。模组引入了一系列二战时期的德国军服，并在军衔位置稍作调整，以展现独特和个性化的风格。每件军服都经过精心设计，准确反映了那个时代的风格与美学，同时为历史爱好者和游戏玩家提供了全新的体验。无论你是追求历史的准确性，还是想提升游戏体验，这款模组都能以现代风格为你呈现历史的迷人风采。</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 肩章&nbsp; </strong></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061187/description_9b8e376a-5b5e-452b-82e6-16695b798385.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"286\" height=\"125\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><br><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 袖标军衔<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061187/description_9afcb55d-46d0-49f0-9360-f6e4cf40dc05.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"183\"><br></span></strong></span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">士兵</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#999\">列兵<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">上等兵<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">豁免兵<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">上等豁免兵<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">参谋豁免兵<br>下级士官<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">下级军士长<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">军士长<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">上等军士长<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">参谋军士长</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">军官</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#999\">少尉<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">中尉<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">上尉<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">少校<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">中校<br></span><span style=\"color:#999\">上校</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">将军</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#999\">少将<br>中将<br>步兵上将<br>大将<br>元帅</span></p>",
